            "content": "<p>We focus on minimal drops which means considered collections, taking the time to craft and innovate. Every piece is sustainable in more ways than one, not just from the materials we use but being rooted in slow fashion.</p><p>We make pieces that last. Not just on quality but versatile design. Made to be worn and styled in multiple ways for you to get creative and keep your looks fresh. </p>"
